=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  logforward alpine --------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Decided: no Figma frame. web-01.example.net runs Alpine 3.23.$
# busybox syslogd forwards over UDP by -R in /etc/conf.d/syslog,$
# set by hardn.$
$
# Log Forwarding ###############################################$
$
  [+] Log Forwarding       Configured 192.0.2.50:514 UDP$
$
  Forwarding ---------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Logger               busybox syslogd$
   -  Server               192.0.2.50:514$
  [ ] Protocol             UDP not encrypted, losses unseen$
   -  File                 /etc/conf.d/syslog$
   -  Set by               hardn$
   -  hardn.yml            192.0.2.50:514 UDP$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Stop forwarding      Undo hardn's change$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0-1 or q]:$
$
$

